### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:5225/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "userage": 25
}

### Create another user
POST http://localhost:5225/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "userage": 30
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5225/users

### Get single user by ID
GET http://localhost:5225/users/1

### Update user by ID
PUT http://localhost:5225/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "username": "alice",
  "userage": 26
}

### Delete user by ID
DELETE http://localhost:5225/users/2
